        "senderName": "NWS Hastings NE",
        "headline": "Flood Advisory issued August 18 at 5:19AM CDT until August 18 at 8:15AM CDT by NWS Hastings NE",
        "description": "* WHAT...Minor flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.\n\n* WHERE...Northeastern Howard County in central Nebraska...\nWest Central Merrick County in central Nebraska...\nSouthwestern Nance County in central Nebraska...\n\n* WHEN...Until 815 AM CDT.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 518 AM CDT, Doppler radar indicated heavy rain due to\nthunderstorms. Minor flooding is ongoing or expected to begin\nshortly in the advisory area.\n- Some locations that will experience flooding include...\nCushing.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood",
        "instruction": "Turn around, don't drown when encountering flooded roads. Most flood\ndeaths occur in vehicles.",
        "response": "Avoid",
        "note": null,
